Package: tcellprolif
Type: Package
Title: T-Cell Proliferation Models for CFSE-Like Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Chilperic Armel", "Foko Kuate", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "chilpericarmel@gmail.com"))
Description: Refactored research code for Smith-Martin and Cyton model simulations and fitting of CFSE-like T-cell proliferation count data. The repository is based on code developed for the AIMS Ghana Master's thesis "Reverse-engineering of T cell proliferation dynamic".
